<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - World Action - 110,000 tonnes Newport News plus Norfolk/Kaohsiung 20-30/3 $11.50/$12.00 fio seven days shinc China Steel.</p>
<p>ORE - SG Universe - 180,000 tonnes Ponta da Madeira/Kwangyang 15-30/3 approx. $9.30 fio scale load/43,000 shinc HMM.</p>
<p>Safore TBN - six trips 150,000 tonnes Saldanha Bay/Japan March 1997/April 1998 $8.40 fio Ischor.</p>
<p>Highlander - 140,000 tonnes Ponta do Ubu/Rotterdam mid March $6.40 fio six days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
</text>
